/// Base raw URL of the Contoso Retail parquet files committed in this repo (examples/contoso-retail/data).
/// A real M PARAMETER (IsParameterQuery) so every partition stays firewall-safe.
/// Refresh works for ANYONE once this repo is PUBLIC — the model streams the .parquet over HTTPS,
/// no SQL Server and no local paths required. To use a fork, branch, tag or a local mirror,
/// change this single value (a folder URL, without a trailing slash).
expression DataBaseUrl = "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/CSalcedoDataBI/fabric-data-agents/main/examples/contoso-retail/data" meta [IsParameterQuery=true, Type="Text", IsParameterQueryRequired=true]
	lineageTag: b0000000-0000-0000-0000-0000000000d0
	annotation PBI_ResultType = Text
